  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orientation Visit - Smart City Solutions Reverse Trade Mission &amp; Workshop, through Tavaci Partners, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contract funds a reserve trade mission visit to the United States and an in-country workshop focused on the development of Indonesia&apos;s new capital city, Nusantara. The primary objective of the activity is to familiarize Indonesian decision makers with U.S. smart city solutions and best practices to support the successful development and implementation of Nusantara that will replace Jakarta as the country&apos;s capital.</narrative>
  </description>
